## Capability

Offer an opt-in, budgeted observation tour with a selected route, dwell, reduced-motion preferences and immediate manual takeover.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Interrupt the tour during a scale transition, return to the starting subject and inspect demand cleanup. Private or missing content cannot become the next target.

